          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ izinamukobga ni yaja mu mihango yiwe, az’ amare imisi ndwi mu miziro yiwe: ūzomukorako wese azoba ahumanye gushitsa ku mugoroba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.15.4+LEV.15.5+LEV.15.6+LEV.15.7+LEV.15.8+LEV.15.9+LEV.15.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 15:4-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikintu cose azoryamako akiri mu miziro yiwe kizoba gihumanye, n’ico azokwicarako cose kizoba gihumanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ umuntu wese azokora ku buriri bgiwe az’ amesure impuzu ziwe, yiyuhagire, akomeze kuba ūhumanye gushitsa ku mugoroba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūzokora ku kintu na kimwe yicayeko, az’ amesure impuzu ziwe, yiyuhagire, akomeze kuba ūhumanye gushitsa ku mugoroba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhereye ku buriri bgiwe, canke ku kintu cose yicayeko, ūzogikorako azoba ahumanye gushitsa ku mugoroba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 18:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ni hagira umugabo aryamana na we, imiziro yiwe ikamwanduza, uwo mugabo azoba ahumanye kumara imisi ndwi: uburiri bgose azoryamako buzoba buhumanye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
